{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One wrong door, and the Atrium will swallow you whole.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in an ancient Roman hall that loops forever. The only way out is to identify what doesn\u2019t belong. Statues turning to face you, banners changing colour, footsteps behind you - anything could be the clue. Choose wrong, and you\u2019re cast back to Hall 0. Choose right, and the Atrium lets you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it's not as easy as just spotting anomalies. Sometimes, the anomaly is obvious - the problem is <i>getting past it</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Atrium\u2019s Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The halls aren\u2019t empty. Angels of death drift silently between the columns, their presence warping the air. Stranger things lurk beyond - entities you can\u2019t yet name, but will come to fear. Some can be avoided\u2026 others demand confrontation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Roguelite Puzzle of Observation and Nerve</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spot the anomaly</strong> \u2013 Each corridor hides something amiss. A banner bleeding new colours. A statue\u2019s eyes that follow you. A torch that burns too cold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left or right</strong> \u2013 Anomaly detected? Take the left door. Nothing wrong? Take the right. But beware: the Atrium has a way of warping your perception.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles in your path</strong> \u2013 Sometimes the left door won\u2019t open until you solve a challenge; locate a hidden key, decipher an inscription, or answer a cryptic riddle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lurking Terrors</strong> \u2013 Angels of Death and nightmarish beings haunt the halls, punishing the slightest mistake.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Stronger with Every Run -\u00a0</strong>Your journey is never wasted. Earn diamonds to unlock permanent upgrades. Like <i>Hindsight</i> to review missed anomalies, <i>Foresight</i> to glimpse anomaly odds, or a <i>Radiant Sword</i> to strike down Angels of Death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer the Final Trial -\u00a0</strong>Hall 10 holds the Atrium\u2019s ultimate guardian. Only the strongest souls will survive what waits there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional Jumpscares\u00a0-</strong> Too scared? Turn them off in settings.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3940090/487a6e6f5e16f89f479aa70fdb984d0db2f164e1.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3940090/c5a86b7f41c807f103c2cc2cfe527cd16d8b00ff.jpg"},{"name":"A Rare Encounter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3940090/d75ddd1391282369f3cfe656a14c2c6b2d5b96bf.jpg"},{"name":"Ascension","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3940090/3816ae46609f18ec6b3999b76572b10c76b726f9.jpg"},{"name":"I Wept","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3940090/190c7407d3f966a17e47ebb1f12e0214d3ac326f.jpg"},{"name":"The Floor is Lava!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3940090/fbbb70913e4de51bb28487ed5000550b4384602d.jpg"},{"name":"Trial by Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3940090/55f0ba4930be5b2edda0170a7b5fe73b058fa6b8.jpg"},{"name":"Cut Above","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3940090/be7a59cda8c811031c60bd75d98051d243153dad.jpg"},{"name":"Celestial Parkour","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3940090/918b9d8fd9ceda95e574c781d3887f3df89fd2a7.jpg"},{"name":"Divine Favour","path":"https://cdn